{{!
    @template tool_vae/export_page

    The page "Exporter le dossier", between its header or heading and the footer: a notification and the way back to the
    dossier; or the archive produced, with the lines the schema refused and the link to download it; or, above the
    confirmation of the core that the page draws itself, what an export is, the archive kept in place and the notice that a
    withdrawal does not reach an archive.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\export_page. The template holds no logic: the
    states exclude one another before. Every text and address is escaped (double braces), except five keys of HTML made by
    the core (triple braces): noticehtml, warninghtml, keptnoticehtml and withdrawalhtml, notifications
    ($output->notification(); the lines refused are drawn by the template tool_vae/export_warnings, the archive kept is a
    sentence and a link drawn by the template tool_vae/cell_content); continuehtml, the button that goes back to the
    dossier ($output->continue_button()).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * noticehtml - false, or HTML: the notification of the state (off, no declaration, archive produced)
    * warninghtml - false, or HTML: the lines the schema refused
    * intro - false, or a string: what an export is
    * keptnoticehtml - false, or HTML: the archive the vaeiste keeps in place
    * withdrawalhtml - false, or HTML: the notice that a withdrawal does not reach an archive
    * download - false, or {url, label}: the link to download the archive produced
    * continuehtml - false, or HTML: the way back to the dossier

    Example context (json):
    {
        "noticehtml": "<div class=\"alert alert-success\">The archive is produced.</div>",
        "warninghtml": false,
        "intro": false,
        "keptnoticehtml": false,
        "withdrawalhtml": false,
        "download": {"url": "https://example.com/pluginfile.php/5/tool_vae/export/7/dossier.zip", "label": "Download the archive"},
        "continuehtml": "<div class=\"continuebutton\"><a href=\"https://example.com/dossier.php\">Continue</a></div>"
    }
}}
{{#noticehtml}}
{{{noticehtml}}}
{{/noticehtml}}
{{#warninghtml}}
{{{warninghtml}}}
{{/warninghtml}}
{{#intro}}
<p>{{intro}}</p>
{{/intro}}
{{#keptnoticehtml}}
{{{keptnoticehtml}}}
{{/keptnoticehtml}}
{{#withdrawalhtml}}
{{{withdrawalhtml}}}
{{/withdrawalhtml}}
{{#download}}
<a href="{{url}}" class="btn btn-primary">{{label}}</a>
{{/download}}
{{#continuehtml}}
{{{continuehtml}}}
{{/continuehtml}}
